    "title": "Hockey opportunities abound for Bartlett exchange students, other newcomers - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Nevala ,\n3 hours ago A foreign exchange student from Chile days away from leaving Alaska and Bartlett High, Javier Ramirez recently confided in his host parents. “He said hockey has been by far the coolest, best experience of his time here,” Jessica Pettit Young wrote in her email to the Golden Bears coaching staff. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
